{
  "name": "Set up the tables",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Set up the tables (run once)\nClick **Execute workflow**. It creates four Data tables in this project and fills in Huda's menu:\n- **price_list**: service_id, name, name_ar, price (AED), unit, includes. Huda edits prices here (Overview, Data tables).\n- **enquiries**: one row per client conversation: status, summary, draft, quote, total, approval link, note.\n- **messages**: the conversation, one row per message.\n- **log**: one row per step.\n\nRunning it again is safe: existing tables are reused, and the menu is reset to the prices below.\n\n*Team Sufra, its users and every figure are fictional.*",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 1500,
        "color": 7
      },
